# .proseignore — files exempted from scripts/lint-prose.mjs em-dash check.
#
# Add a path with a one-line reason above it. Anything added here is opting OUT
# of the no-em-dashes rule, so the reason should be load-bearing.
#
# CHANGELOG historical entries: rewriting history is lying. New entries must
# still avoid em-dashes; older ones are grandfathered.
# (handled by DEFAULT_EXCLUDES in scripts/lint-prose.mjs)

# Worktrees and tmp dirs: not project source.
# (handled by DEFAULT_EXCLUDES)

# docs/reference/ is entirely auto-generated by construct docs:site from hook
# descriptions, CLI command source, and agents/registry.json. Em-dashes are
# stripped from the specialist table but carry through in other auto-generated
# tables. Fix belongs in the generators; until then all reference output is
# exempt. Hand-written docs (concepts/, cookbook/, start/) are not exempt.
docs/reference/
